From 1d715896a1ab744689ef86b8287d14d3aec7883b Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Peter Stewart <peter@stewartmail.xyz>
Date: Sat, 21 Feb 2026 15:04:23 +1100
Subject: [PATCH 05/14] qcap: Implement IAMCameraControl interface for V4L2
 capture devices.
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

Add IAMCameraControl to the VFW capture filter, supporting GetRange,
Get, and Set for camera terminal controls (pan, tilt, zoom, exposure,
iris, focus). Exposure values are converted between Windows log2-second
units and V4L2 linear 100µs units.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>
(cherry picked from commit a2230516b5ecd7f38005324cedd4dacf5a2c713d)
